Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We take in the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now, we're set to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.92,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We take in the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.18,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.46,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.10,0:03:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The same time I think so, this swordsman\Ncan project his attacks as well that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.84,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai zombies using the power of my\Nshadow to move around right now but.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Before his death he must have been an\Nincredibly strong man which means the.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Combination of his strength my technique\Nwill make him quite formidable indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say that those two\Ndead even I'm saying these two swordsmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.24,0:03:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have an incredible amount\Nof destructive power at
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,their command and as such\NI don't think this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Will last long prelude
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.98,0:03:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,of them he's trying to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,break my sword two sword
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,style flash demon bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.24,0:03:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shabbat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.88,0:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Born them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword-style draw!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.56,0:03:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rush him on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.42,0:04:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.54,0:04:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He took the hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They cut through the pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Easy! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This floor, it's gonna\Nbreak apart! What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.86,0:04:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, this place has fallen to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,72-caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Polka-releezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons left!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.18,0:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap, I'm going to slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.84,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, even without a foothold.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.08,0:05:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If this goes on much longer,\Nmy sword's going to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy doesn't just have the\Nstrength of that legendary samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got his wits, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Flying dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Reverse humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.24,0:06:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Aramont Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.70,0:06:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who won't cut fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,My defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:07:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary owner of this\Nblade may have long since falling
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But its story does not end\Nhere. With you as its master,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.82,0:07:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,this sword will surely be satisfied
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounded like the\Nsamurai said something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I couldn't understand him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? In short,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like the battle between them is\Nover I've seen many fights in my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but none quite like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot Samurai, he scarcely used a fraction\Nof his strength when he was fighting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an impressive battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.62,0:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This body of a legendary samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How shameful of me to\Nallow it to no defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you feel shame, it's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a true swordsman in\Nbody and spirit, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have met you in your era.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's back, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,After five long years, my shadow is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.98,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this sword like I said, but let's\Npretend like this fight never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.64,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Samurai from Wano
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.94,0:08:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be captured\Nby the power of your own friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and this one use some dumb\Ntrick to try and feed me some salt
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe Sanji's so far gone\Nalready that he would kick Robin like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not our friend anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.30,0:08:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this Sanji you keep talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can save you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.40,0:09:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuss, fuss, fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to be the bearer of bad tidings,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but these two might not have any\Nmemory of beating your friends left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,some zombies retain a small\Nsense of their former selves,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,but the new body and\Nsoul soon synchronize.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a shred of humanity remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They all become obedient zombies\Nthat follow my every command.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.60,0:09:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,For a zombie following orders\Nis the pinnacle of existence!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You finally convinced me you're an\Nevil man all the way to the core?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.68,0:09:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,hog back
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the past you were responsible\Nfor saving so many lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.08,0:09:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I really looked up to you as\Na humanitarian and a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even mind your\Nresearch on zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as how death\Ncan happen so suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,those who die and those who are left behind\Nalways leave so many things left unsaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Things that they'll never\Nhave a chance to say again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If there was some way to bring\Nthe deceased back to life,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,even for only a moment, that brief\Ntime could be spent finding closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if people called\Nyou a heretic or a mad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,scientist and announced\Nall the work you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.04,0:10:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It would have been worth\Nit to heal people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.38,0:10:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why when you said\Nyou had spent years in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,this place researching\Nhow to resurrect the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.56,0:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed you were doing it\Nwith the best of intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,False. False. False. Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would go to that much\Ntrouble to help others?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your naivete is astounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.88,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the way it's always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a genius who deserves the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.06,0:10:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Money was the driving force\Nbehind using my skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.40,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But my notoriety led patients from\Nall over the world to my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There were too many needy little whiners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Save my father, please save my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Save my sweetheart, nag,\Nnag, nag, what a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.46,0:10:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I was expected to carry\Nthe burden of all the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,incompetent doctors\Nwho couldn't help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you starting to understand\Nthe horrors of being a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to idolize me for my\Nwork in the medical field, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you have no right to\Nsay you're disappointed in
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,me if my motives don't live\Nup to your precious ideals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.58,0:11:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can just kiss my\Nass you stupid reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you preach to\Nme on how to be a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm\Ntrying to do you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.86,0:11:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even accept\Nyou as a doctor anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.94,0:11:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't accept these zombies either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.44,0:11:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They're already dead, yet you\Nstill have control over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.58,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't let them rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a mockery of human life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.08,0:11:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a narrow-minded thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.36,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them a new life, and yet you think\Nthey should just be rotting in the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're missing the\Nscientific breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.96,0:11:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them life after\Ndeath. Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.80,0:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you simply overlook\Nthe value of that life?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,AVAILABLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.34,0:12:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.84,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, while you're down\Nthere, lick the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.08,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Master Hogback.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.66,0:12:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw that room,\Ndidn't you, Dr. Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.40,0:12:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That was actually my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The photos on the wall are of a deceased\Nstage actress named Victoria Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I was infatuated with her and her\Ncharm for as long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Her beauty and allure\Ncaptured not only my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but the hearts of men\Nall over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's as good as new, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe one of my\Npatients sewed a button on for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She was popular without conceit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.10,0:13:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She was kind and loving to her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She was a wonderful woman thoughtful and\Ngenerous to everyone, but unfortunately?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,She was also spoken for after I made\Nmy mark as a doctor I proposed to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But as she was already\Nengaged, she refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the terrible news\Nabout what had happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She had suffered a fatal accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.32,0:13:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I was at a loss for words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, I left my job behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when he found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He appeared out of nowhere with\Nthe solution to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My master, Gecko Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.00,0:14:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I could use a man of your talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Linda, too, made Dr. Hog back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I accepted his offer and boarded\Nhis ship on one condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.96,0:14:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That he, combining his amazing\Nabilities with my own,?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,would help me bring my\NShandora back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.62,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole her corpse in order to obtain a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shandora that would belong\Nto and obey only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's alive! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish every last plate in the\Nworld would disappear What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Her personality had changed and it\Ncertainly wasn't for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.74,0:14:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However, she was still beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.04,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And frankly, that was\Nall the matter to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy and I'm sure she is as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've given her a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A chance to rejoin this world\Nas a living human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You call that a living human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell her to stop that! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A human being whose heart and body\Nhave been separated is no human at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You took a corpse that had\Nno choice in the matter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.30,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and turned it into nothing\Nmore than a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.02,0:15:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time you make\None of these creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.70,0:15:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somewhere there's\Na human you've devastated
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.56,0:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with pain and sorrow and I\Ncan't let you go unpunished!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would a stupid\Nreindeer pirate doctor with
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,such limited medical skill\Npossibly know about life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinri, rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise and kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.92,0:15:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you two are next on the zombie list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.02,0:15:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy, Dr. Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:16:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You may die, but once you're brought back\Nyou'll be the assistant of the doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've idolized so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,square plate blades
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.70,0:16:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.22,0:16:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,False, false, false.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her size fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite her petite figure, I've\Nmodified her to be a killing machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Shandora, you don't have\Nto take orders from that maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.28,0:16:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.46,0:16:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.16,0:16:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Look what Hogback's done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.74,0:16:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What would your family say\Nif they knew about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.98,0:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been stitched together like a\Nragdoll, forced to serve as an undead slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.84,0:17:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your loved ones would be mortified.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, unhand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You were born with both a body and a\Nsoul, but that soul died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.16,0:17:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet your body is being\Nforced to follow orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.24,0:17:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the meaning in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Force, force, force, force.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you doubt\Nyour own eyes, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what humans\Nhave always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Resurrection of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Man can live again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because it moves\Ndoesn't make it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.24,0:17:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,To be alive, you've got to be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're treating her like she's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.50,0:17:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything that exists like\Nthat can't be a human being!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkma Tackle! Help her! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Save Century!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.27,0:17:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.58,0:18:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.32,0:18:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gleason style, 108!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.84,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.38,0:18:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, don't save Fleur!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My master said, kill the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful with that attack\Nyou almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay the hell out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I was doing fine till you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.84,0:18:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Master told me to kill the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes I know that we have\Nthe same master you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.68,0:18:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He said kill the others\NI'll start with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:19:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you idiots doing stop\Nfighting now we need to work together right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.82,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't give orders if you\Ncan't talk if the others
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are everyone but Shandora\Nwho knows what could end
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,up happening even without\Nany trace of their old
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,memories those two just\Ncan't seem to get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.86,0:19:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This tower is rather tall, isn't\Nit? Hmm. If only we were under.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.22,0:19:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,your power you could kill us\Nby asking us to jump out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.18,0:19:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.18,0:19:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to\Nme that way you'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,under my control once I\Nturn you into zombies and!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.86,0:19:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I do, I'll say jump off this\Ntower and put an end to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.00,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, master! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.90,0:19:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! That was a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As for us, we'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.52,0:20:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You pathetic excuses\Nfor humans tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to be a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, once Luffy's dealt with Moria,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.12,0:20:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,all the zombies he created on\Nthis island will be purified,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.14,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,which means the only thing left for\Nme to do around here is kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Century, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to buy some\Ntime while I escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me? Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if they purify you,\NI can just give you another shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.54,0:20:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My body...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Send me!
